            "value": "Quando ativado, todas as janelas serão escurecidas, exceto as atualmente selecionadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, hovering over an app in the Dock shows windows from all instances of that app. When disabled, shows only windows from the specific instance under the mouse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "When enabled, hovering over an app in the Dock shows windows from all instances of that app. When disabled, shows only windows from the specific instance under the mouse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, moving the mouse back over the preview during fade-out will not reactivate it. You must hover over the dock icon again to show the preview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "When enabled, moving the mouse back over the preview during fade-out will not reactivate it. You must hover over the dock icon again to show the preview."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, pressing Shift alone won't go back. Use Shift+Tab (or modifier+Shift+Tab when release-to-select is on) to navigate backward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "When enabled, pressing Shift alone won't go back. Use Shift+Tab (or modifier+Shift+Tab when release-to-select is on) to navigate backward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, pressing the backward key alone won't go back. Use it with Tab to navigate backward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "When enabled, pressing the backward key alone won't go back. Use it with Tab to navigate backward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, shows the last active window first instead of the current window": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando ativado, mostrará a última janela ativa primeiro em vez da janela atual"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, shows visual indicators and dims minimized/hidden windows. When disabled, treats them as normal windows with full functionality.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "When enabled, shows visual indicators and dims minimized/hidden windows. When disabled, treats them as normal windows with full functionality."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, switching between dock icons while a preview is already open will show previews instantly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "When enabled, switching between dock icons while a preview is already open will show previews instantly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the current window keeps its aspect ratio. The width and height percentages are treated as maximum bounds; if they differ, the result often matches uniform scaling to the smaller bound.": {
      "comment": "Explanation for lock aspect ratio behavior in title bar scroll centered window sizing",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "When enabled, the current window keeps its aspect ratio. The width and height percentages are treated as maximum bounds; if they differ, the result often matches uniform scaling to the smaller bound."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, window previews show live video instead of static screenshots. Uses ScreenCaptureKit for real-time capture.": {
